OL,3,GNEWSANurse missing in Nepal-Tibet flash
OL,4,Aflood
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent hospital nurse is missing in
OL,7,FNepal after severe flooding struck a
OL,8,Fpilgrimage route.
OL,10,FSarada Simkhada, a senior nurse at
OL,11,FDarent Valley Hospital, is among the
OL,12,Fhundreds of people reported missing
OL,13,Fafter devastating flash flooding hit
OL,14,Fnear the Nepal-Tibet border.
OL,16,FShe was on a pilgrimage to Mount
OL,17,FKailash when she lost contact with
OL,18,Frelatives and her brother, Shambhu,
OL,19,Fsaid the family was desperately waiting
OL,20,Ffor news of her safety.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
