OL,3,GNEWSANurse missing in Nepal-Tibet flash
OL,4,Aflood
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe wrote on social media: "My dear
OL,7,Fsister, wherever you are, please stay
OL,8,Fstrong. We are praying for your safety
OL,9,Fevery moment and waiting desperately
OL,10,Ffor you to return home."
